    "source_answer": "4.4 m",
    "previous_model_response": "The difference in pole heights is\n\n\\[\n25-8=17\\text{ m}.\n\\]\n\nUsing the \\(57^\\circ\\) angle of elevation,\n\n\\[\n\\tan 57^\\circ=\\frac{17}{BC}.\n\\]\n\nThus,\n\n\\[\nBC=\\frac{17}{\\tan 57^\\circ}\\approx 11.04\\text{ m}.\n\\]\n\nRounded to one decimal place:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{11.0}\n\\]"
  },
